+"""Drive the production keyboard button handling with PaperDIY two-key frames.
+
+Frames follow the SDK DigitalTwoButton classifier (see
+freeink-sdk/libs/hardware/InputManager/test/host/test_paperdiy.cpp): a tap emits
+Up or Down pressed and released in one update; a hold emits only Back (A) or
+Confirm (B). The same code is also built for other boards, where Up keeps
+moving one row up.
